1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,161
Every day, India's food brands write off stock that sells too slowly.

2
00:00:05,211 --> 00:00:11,127
Too close to expiry for quick commerce, it is destroyed, and its GST credit reversed.

3
00:00:11,377 --> 00:00:14,455
Smart-Clearance turns that write-off into recovery.

4
00:00:14,505 --> 00:00:24,184
It is software as a service for FMCG brands: each gets its own workspace, where AI agents find the best exit for every pack at risk.

5
00:00:24,434 --> 00:00:31,048
Ten agents on Gemini, built with Google's Agent Development Kit, walk every batch through nine stops.

6
00:00:31,098 --> 00:00:37,511
The Watcher spots the risk. Vision verifies the label. The Valuer and the Router price every exit.

7
00:00:37,461 --> 00:00:39,347
Then one person says yes.

8
00:00:39,297 --> 00:00:46,871
Outreach, the Lister and the Negotiator sell. Paperwork files the GST papers, and Impact posts the ledger.

9
00:00:47,121 --> 00:00:54,667
In the console, Neha brings a brand on in minutes: its stock export mapped by the Data agent, and its people invited.

10
00:00:54,617 --> 00:01:01,526
Each SKU gets its own quick-commerce gates, and every agent is set to act, ask, or only suggest.

11
00:01:01,876 --> 00:01:07,989
What follows is live, on production. Everyone signs in on their own device, to the real apps.

12
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:13,577
The API and the agents run on Cloud Run, and every agent reasons with Gemini.

13
00:01:15,027 --> 00:01:23,093
For the demo, Neha switches Munchly to Rehearsal: a journey day passes in an hour, so the real best-before dates still hold.

14
00:01:23,143 --> 00:01:32,827
Priya, in supply chain, gets the Watcher's alert. Munchly's Mango Drink, in Hyderabad: twenty-two days left, twenty-two thousand rupees at stake.

15
00:01:32,877 --> 00:01:40,571
Lakshmi Agencies, the distributor, is asked for one photo. Vision matches the carton's label to the stock export.

16
00:01:40,621 --> 00:01:47,115
The Valuer prices every exit, and the Router splits the batch. Priya approves the plan with one tap.

17
00:01:47,165 --> 00:01:58,243
Outreach sends the offer to fifty-eight kiranas in their own language: in this demo, Hindi. A shopkeeper orders on her phone, and the order lands on Priya's screen, live.

18
00:01:58,293 --> 00:02:04,652
Next on the roadmap: more Indian languages, and WhatsApp, to reach kiranas in every remote region.

19
00:02:04,702 --> 00:02:10,568
Fifty-two shops take thirteen hundred and seventy-two packets, each with its own tax invoice.

20
00:02:10,618 --> 00:02:17,967
The godown's staff buy a hundred and fifty packs, paying by UPI, and Vision checks the receipt against the count.

21
00:02:18,017 --> 00:02:24,026
Feeding India collects the last fifty-eight packs, and the Saturday van delivers every shop's order.

22
00:02:24,076 --> 00:02:32,027
Paperwork drafts every paper. Munchly recovers nearly seventeen thousand rupees, and Lakshmi Agencies ends whole.

23
00:02:33,777 --> 00:02:42,134
But not every batch sells. Munchly's Masala Chips go to Rakesh Traders' thirty-eight kiranas in Nagpur, and just two of them order.

24
00:02:42,184 --> 00:02:52,832
On ExpireSoon, a wholesaler in Raipur bids thirteen rupees. The Negotiator counters at fourteen twenty, and seven hundred and seventy-two packs are sold.

25
00:02:52,882 --> 00:02:57,489
Five hundred and forty packets are still left when the offer window closes.

26
00:02:57,539 --> 00:03:03,606
On expiry day, Rakesh is asked to destroy them through an authorised agency, and to prove it.

27
00:03:03,656 --> 00:03:12,418
At the landfill, he photographs the destruction. Then the agency's officer, two witnesses and Rakesh sign the certificate on his tablet.

28
00:03:12,468 --> 00:03:18,944
Vision checks the photos. Only on Priya's second yes are the certificate and the credit note issued.

29
00:03:18,994 --> 00:03:27,907
Even here, Munchly recovers eleven thousand seven hundred rupees against a twenty-six thousand rupee write-off, and Rakesh ends whole.

30
00:03:28,557 --> 00:03:35,996
Smart-Clearance. Live on Cloud Run, reasoning with Gemini. Ten agents, one yes, and nothing good goes to waste.
